          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>To add two fractions with like denominators, we add the numerators and keep the denominators the same. Therefore,</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: (2)/(9) + (3)/(9) = (2 + 3)/(9) = (5)/(9).]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "To add two fractions with like denominators, we add the numerators and keep the denominators the same. Therefore,\n\n[MATH: (2)/(9) + (3)/(9) = (2 + 3)/(9) = (5)/(9).]",
